.TL
Heart: The City Beneath
.pdfhref O 1 "How To Play"
.SH
How To Play
.LP
Roll two ten sided dice and keep the higher. Skills, domains and knacks all
add to the roll when they apply to what the character is attempting to do.
.bp
.pdfhref O 1 "Characters"
.pdfhref O 2 "Callings"
.SH
Characters: Callings
.LP
A calling is the reason a character descends into the Heart. Each calling
carries its own beats and its own zenith. The callings are the Heart, the
Enlightenment and the Vermissian. A character has exactly one calling, and
the Heretic is a class rather than a calling.
.pdfhref O 3 "The Heart Calling"
.pdfhref O 3 "The Enlightenment Calling"
.pdfhref O 3 "The Vermissian Calling"
.bp
.pdfhref O 2 "Classes"
.SH
Characters: Classes
.LP
A class describes what a character does. Each class has its own abilities,
resistances and equipment, and no two members of a party may share one. The
classes are the Cleaver, the Deadwalker, the Deep Apiarist, the Heretic, the
Hound, the Incarnadine, the Junk Mage, the Vermissian Knight and the Witch.
There is no class called simply the Knight, and none called the Mage.
.pdfhref O 3 "Cleaver"
